<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's NAIB bank raises profits.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's NAIB bank raises profits.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Africa International Bank NAIB on Tuesday said its net profits at end-July 1996 amounted to $2.157 million, up by 25 percent compared to $1.725 million during the same period last year.</p>
<p>Net profits for the whole year 1995 were $2.570 million, up by 70.72 percent compared to $1.505 million in 1994.</p>
<p>NAIB, a state-controlled bank, has a subscribed capital of $30 million.</p>
</text>
